.env
data/
*.parquet
*.duckdb

# data/portable/reina_marts.duckdb is a 7MB PII-free marts-only artifact that
# lets a clone run the MCP server with no Redshift access (`make portable`).
# It is client-DERIVED data, so it stays ignored until the data owner approves
# redistribution. To ship it, uncomment the negation below and commit the file.
# !data/portable/reina_marts.duckdb
__pycache__/
.venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# evals/results.json was ignored as a transient run artifact. It is now the
# only evidence behind the 9/11 pass rate quoted in the README, and it is 41 KB
# of aggregate figures with no member/patient identifiers (scanned). Committed
# deliberately; re-ignore it only if a run starts carrying row-level output.
# evals/results.json
evals/results.partial.json
